"""
Ultra-Large Model Hardware & Quantization Manager
Downloads, optimizes, and registers ultra-large models (70B-405B) onto secondary storage (/mnt/games/large-models)
Tailored for 32-thread AMD Zen CPU, 30.4 GB DDR5 RAM, and 8 GB GDDR7 NVIDIA RTX 5060 Laptop GPU.
"""

